<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100767" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνόδους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οντος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with teeth opposing, rather than
				notching into, one another</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρχαρόδους</span> (q.v.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ
				συνόδοντα</span>
			<i>animals with such teeth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				595a9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνόδοντες, οἱ</span> (sg. ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.322b
			</span></i>), a kind of <i>sea-bream</i>, prob. <i>Dentex
			vulgaris</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.51
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Archestr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.170
			</span></i>: sg. nom. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνόδων</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				132.3
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Philox.
				2.15
			</span></i>; but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνόδους</span></b> 
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.186
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.14
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σινόδους,
		συνώδοντα</span>.</div>
